<title>USA: Cooker Restaurant to buy back 500,000 shrs.</title>
<headline>Cooker Restaurant to buy back 500,000 shrs.</headline>
<dateline>WEST PALM BEACH, Fla. 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cooker Restaurant Corp said Friday its board had authorized the repurchase of up to 500,000 shares.</p>
<p>It said shares purchased under this authorization will be used primarily for matching contributions to the company's 401K retirement plan, introduced earlier this year.</p>
<p>The company has more than 10 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>Cooker operates 52 &quot;Cooker Bar and Grill&quot; restaurants.</p>
</text>
